hot 2024-12-04 182809.png", "id": "1085149306258970", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540506_1085149312925636_6131579653421489203_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YC7tPTdueu0Q7kNvwHAXokz&_nc_oc=Adp8Imh6St-quk6zgVqm_KT-XPdSEY4Mn3890bn5z-0hZy4eViY5JcOmNU3xNWcDQpE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJhSLY8Se2IMfP_SoYa4dDF3dgrHLNsX1B2fvdMot5WLg&oe=6AB7E4FC"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2024-12-04 183005.png", "id": "4213717535527766", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75375749_4213717538861099_4020599651298427082_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z__7gpEjlksQ7kNvwEHGae5&_nc_oc=Ador1Eegy4XmVcjLObzlekGGveXaEmyPOc4MbzCmj1R_xnXKyr7PWvvRK8wi6yOl2-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJEC5_CVrrRY6HPrQlghvIFPHoM0vKuUYGtsro9IcaIOw&oe=6AB7BD8D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2024-12-04 183241.png", "id": "499640243131183", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569446_499640246464516_3150957488509734960_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CLFb7nNjMNIQ7kNvwFreMg8&_nc_oc=Adq1_2VWH4KBcWvxK3fg-EDzpZyykvkytUaNo4vOoDOE3NDvCErMec5sKbIroAgzKuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLrce_sl1DammQx-tyl5kpPCRMlm1CRK-_rQerUPXa2LQ&oe=6AB7EE9A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "GoofyOofer", "keywords": [], "long_description": "GoofyOofer is a Multiplayer Horror VR Game where you play as a Chimp and can only move with your hands with NO LEGS!! You also have lots of opportunities like exploring a cave with monsters inside and going deeper inside down to a secret lab with more monsters, you can also play TAG with other Chimps! or just be in a casual game mode with other chimps. You can also go shopping and get new Clothes and Hats and More! Welcome to GoofyOofer! Play now for free.", "short_description": "GoofyOofer is a Multiplayer Horror VR Game w